&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_bdf6c1b5dfec2a38&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;We are looking for an Administrative Business Partner to join our team. This is a Hybrid role based out of our Escazú office 3 days per week, reporting to the SVP, Global Customer Support. Our general and administrative teams help support and scale our company, providing a strong foundation for growth across our workforce, culture, financial operations, and global infrastructure. Put your passion, drive, and expertise to work with the world&#39;s cloud security leader.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Oversee executive calendars, prioritize tasks, resolve scheduling conflicts, and ensure smooth coordination of meetings and engagements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Plan internal and external meetings, All Hands, and events, managing logistics like conference rooms, catering, and preparation of materials&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Submit monthly expense reports, process reimbursements, and coordinate domestic and international travel with fully detailed itineraries&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Handle sensitive matters discreetly while upholding confidentiality in all administrative tasks&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Maintain and update org charts, directories, and team initiatives like competitions and recognition programs for alignment and effective implementation&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You are comfortable building the path as you walk it, seeing dynamic and changing environments as an opportunity to construct something meaningful.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;You are a problem-solver. You seek out challenges with high energy, taking pride in delivering solutions to complex problems that drive meaningful business impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;You are customer-obsessed. You build deep empathy for internal and external partners, anchoring every operational decision in solving real-world challenges to ensure collective success.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;You operate with urgency. You maintain a high bias for action and a relentless focus on execution, understanding that speed and quality go hand in hand in a high-growth environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;You are resilient and adaptable. You view change as an opportunity, maintaining composure, focus, and a steady hand through evolving priorities and high-pressure situations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and active exploration of AI tools, with a proven history of integrating new technologies to enhance daily workflows and augment problem-solving&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience providing executive-level administrative support&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to schedule and coordinate complex internal and external meetings, events, and logistical arrangements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in tools such as Zoom, Outlook, Word, PowerPoint, Google Suite, and expense reporting platforms like Coupa&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities, proactively resolve issues, and de-escalate challenges&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Exceptional interpersonal communication skills, with experience collaborating across all levels of an organization and supporting interaction with external stakeholders&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and maintain strong relationships with internal and external counterparts to ensure open communication and operational efficiency&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;High adaptability to changing circumstances, last-minute adjustments, and shifting organizational priorities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel to the U.S. 2-3 times per year to provide onsite logistics and support for key events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;#LI-IA1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
